{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 You are the 100th challenger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where 99 people have challenged, mastered their respective paths, and left their mark before departing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the AI \u200b\u200bguide &quot;Aki&quot; and the mysterious &quot;Tora-neko,&quot; you, as the 100th challenger, will uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 A business battle using patents as your weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In three industries\u2014pharmaceuticals, machinery, and software\u2014this is a turn-based simulation where you grow your company by utilizing all aspects of intellectual property, from research and development to patent applications, license negotiations, and litigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own business strategy amidst the tactics of AI companies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 A business sim with boss battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story that deepens with each playthrough. Secrets hidden behind everyday life. And bosses that stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your business skills and reach the heart of the story\u2014follow the records of your predecessors and unravel the truth of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Expanding story in the full version (released April 17th)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current demo allows you to play up to the second boss. The full version adds a final boss battle and a true story episode, revealing the stories of all 99 predecessors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Free to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play for free until the end.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4154200?t=1774868858","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154200/58b28945b596dc0dc62074bf9900089f8d083a91/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774868858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154200/d0f96581711cdd1bbb22401171c87cf80daecd5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774868858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154200/d0f96581711cdd1bbb22401171c87cf80daecd5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774868858","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4221830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 You are the 100th challenger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where 99 people have challenged, mastered their respective paths, and left their mark before departing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by the AI \u200b\u200bguide &quot;Aki&quot; and the mysterious &quot;Tora-neko,&quot; you, as the 100th challenger, will uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 A business battle using patents as your weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In three industries\u2014pharmaceuticals, machinery, and software\u2014this is a turn-based simulation where you grow your company by utilizing all aspects of intellectual property, from research and development to patent applications, license negotiations, and litigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own business strategy amidst the tactics of AI companies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 A business sim with boss battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story that deepens with each playthrough. Secrets hidden behind everyday life. And bosses that stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your business skills and reach the heart of the story\u2014follow the records of your predecessors and unravel the truth of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Expanding story in the full version (released April 17th)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current demo allows you to play up to the second boss. The full version adds a final boss battle and a true story episode, revealing the stories of all 99 predecessors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Free to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play for free until the end.</p>","developers":["Torasute"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154200/a2584322ecadd2ffdde3c0cd17e141aace44bba9/header.jpg?t=1774868858","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4154200/484199401/f2fa3fe5add00e1d1cb0e0cc7f5922fb615c77c1/1765452711/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765453152","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4154200/484199401/f2fa3fe5add00e1d1cb0e0cc7f5922fb615c77c1/1765452711/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765453152","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4154200/484199401/f2fa3fe5add00e1d1cb0e0cc7f5922fb615c77c1/1765452711/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765453152","id":257247345,"name":"Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257247345/b8ff55a4cbe57242a68e893ef8da8f73f0acb4d2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765453152"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4154200/440552857/980a2345a1419b518c8d8fe500b987f226bb1fab/1774867708/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774868065","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers